Z||000000||ToddAsh||01-20-2001||10:48 PM||||Has anyone been to the import-kit car show in May.Are there a lot of Fieros,parts,Fiero vendors.Plan on taking my new '85 SE there.Just got Classic tags on it and put it on the road after 15 years in storage.Brand new condition with 14,000 miles and loaded. I've had quite a few Vettes and lots of other fun cars but NOTHING is as much fun as this car.People look at me like I'm crazy when I rave about it. Thats OK,keep those prices down while I find a nice '88 GT to put next to the '85. Very Addictive Vehicle. Thanks everyone for all this great info. Todd||||reg||6
