Z||000012||Eric_PA||01-21-2001||12:16 PM||||I was there last year, but without my Fiero. I am definately going again this year, but don't know if I will have a Fiero ready. I can't make my darn mind up on what to do with an engine swap. I was going to put a HO Q4 in, but this is my first more than 4 cylinder car I have owned and starting to like having the extra torque. If I can sell this Quad I will probably put in a TPI V8 with the automatic. I am beginning to really like Archie's Master V8 Kit, and seen his cars last year at the show.||||reg||6
